    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d214">

                <pb facs="0307" n="233" sameAs="frus:frus1918Russiav01/pg233"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 861.00/661</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Minister in
                        Sweden</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Morris</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-11-16T15:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">November 16, 1917, 3 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>408. Your 991, November 15, 9 p.m.<anchor n="1" xml:id="d214-f1"/> Try advise
                    Francis Department has nothing from him since his 1964, November 8. Apparently
                    wireless stations also blocked. Please continue to advise Department which is
                    anxious for information conditions specially welfare Embassy and Consulate
                    staffs and other Americans in Russia.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Polk</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
